## ⏱️ Complexity

### Time Complexity

```text
O(n)
```

The first loop visits every element once, and the second loop visits the remaining positions. Together, they take linear time.

### Space Complexity

```text
O(1)
```

We use only a few variables (`i` and `j`) and modify the original array directly. No extra array is created.

---

## 📌 Key Takeaways

* Move non-zero elements to the front.
* Use `i` to search and `j` to track the destination.
* Preserve the original order of non-zero elements.
* Fill all remaining positions with zeros.
* Modify the original array in place.
* Time complexity: `O(n)`.
* Extra space complexity: `O(1)`.

